<title>USA: U.S. Govt wins major court victory against Staples.</title>
<headline>U.S. Govt wins major court victory against Staples.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. District Judge Thomas Hogan on Monday granted government trustbusters a crucial preliminary injunction halting a $4 billion merger of office superstore chains Staples Inc. and Office Depot Inc. , Federal Trade Commission lawyers said.</p>
</text>
